        <article class="icard"><span class="ik">Shattered Blade</span><b>{de ? 'Dreifrontenkampf' : 'Three-way fights'}</b><small>{de ? 'Vanduul und die Shattered Blade kämpfen um dasselbe Gebiet, und InterSec will beide loswerden.' : 'The Vanduul and the Shattered Blade fight over the same ground, and InterSec wants both gone.'}</small><div class="chips"><a class="chip" href={L('/missionen/engage-shattered-blade-and-vanduul.html')}>Engage Shattered Blade and Vanduul</a><a class="chip" href={L('/missionen/neutralize-vanduul-and-shattered-blade-threat.html')}>Neutralize Vanduul and Shattered Blade Threat</a><a class="chip" href={L('/missionen/stop-vanduul-and-shattered-blade-hostilities.html')}>Stop Vanduul and Shattered Blade Hostilities</a></div></article>
        <article class="icard"><span class="ik">{de ? 'An Bord' : 'Aboard'}</span><b>{de ? 'Entern und Bergen' : 'Boarding and recovery'}</b><small>{de ? 'Ein geentertes Schiff zurückerobern, eine lebende Vanduul-Probe in der ' : 'Retake a boarded vessel, deliver a living Vanduul sample in its '}{de ? 'Kryokapsel' : 'cryopod'}{de ? ' abliefern und gezielte Abschüsse, deren Bauplan das ' : ' and targeted kills whose blueprint reward is the '}<a href={L('/crafting/skarnov-raider-camo-rifle.html')}>{de ? 'Skarnov „Raider Camo“' : 'Skarnov "Raider Camo"'}</a>{de ? ' ist.' : '.'}</small><div class="chips"><a class="chip" href={L('/missionen/retake-boarded-vessel.html')}>Retake Boarded Vessel</a><a class="chip" href={L('/missionen/living-vanduul-sample.html')}>Living Vanduul Sample</a><a class="chip" href={L('/missionen/intersec-eliminate-specific-rank1.html')}>Intersec Eliminate Specific Rank1</a></div><a class="route" href={L('/missionen.html')}>{de ? '1.387 → 1.399 Familien' : '1,387 → 1,399 families'} →</a></article>
